'''Vis Fatties''' spawn with a Fetal Demon attached to their slit abdomens. The Fatty will slowly walk towards the player while the Fetal Demon occasionally lunges towards Isaac if he gets too close. As it is tethered, the Demon has a limited range of movement. Occasionally, the Vis Fatty will fart, which briefly pushes the Fetal Demon away, giving it a substantial increase in range, as well as creating puddles of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] around the Fatty, the Demon, and the cord that attaches them.

If the Fatty is killed first, the Demon will be broken free and continuously chase down the player similar to {{E|Gemini|Display=Gemini's}} Suture. If the Demon is killed first, the Vis Fatty unleashes a {{i|Brimstone}} laser in the closest diagonal direction to Isaac. It will then fly backwards around the room diagonally, bumping off of walls and tall blocks, all while continuously shooting {{i|Brimstone}} behind it.

